				<wikidot:authorName>Mr Lapin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5968622</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've been taking a real dive into the UIU, testing the waters for various GOIs that could be fun.</p> <p>I love these sorts of &quot;merely&quot; inexplicable anomalies, especially the not simply harmless but kind of helpful nature for the fish themselves.</p> <p>As stated above, I would read stories that give them a role.</p> 
				 	]]>
