					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2194643#post-2782254</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2194643/uiu-file:1997-007#post-2782254</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 02 Apr 2017 21:02:31 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>2093189</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Laughed my ass off at:</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Crimes:</strong> Not applicable, as animals cannot be charged with crimes. However, if applicable, the charges of chronic disruption of the peace and disorderly conduct would be applied.</p> </blockquote> <p>Basically inferring that animals should be prosecuted for human crimes.</p> <p>This shows just why UIU is Useless. I don't even wanna know how the fish answer the phones.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2194643#post-2782111</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2194643/uiu-file:1997-007#post-2782111</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 02 Apr 2017 16:43:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kakroom</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2198340</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think ordinarily the premise of a group of telepathic loaches would be rather thin, but in the case I think you turned did it justice. The UIU and their down-to-Earth worldview were, in my eyes, the best choice for taking on such a minute, charming parathreat. The way you work their handle of rudimentary English is just right; I didn't feel the need to suspend my disbelief too strenuously, nor did it end up a missed opportunity and depressingly deadpan.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
